:: Ocean Breeze

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>

<<if $oceanbreezejob>><<timeTrackingEndCafe>><</if>>

<<if $chef_sus gt 0>>
	Suspicion:
	<div class="meter">
		<<set _percent=Math.floor(($chef_sus / 100)*100)>>
		<<print '<div class="redbar" style="width:' + _percent + '%"></div>'>>
	</div>
<</if>>

You are in the Ocean Breeze Cafe.
<<if Time.openingHours()>>
	<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
		No one is sitting outside due to the rain, but the cafe proper is crowded.
	<<elseif Weather.isFreezing>>
		No one is sitting outside due to the cold, but the cafe proper is crowded.
	<<elseif !Weather.isOvercast>>
		Most of the tables are full.
	<<else>>
		The cafe is busy, and despite the strong winds some people are sitting outside.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<<passoutshop "cafe">>

<<elseif Time.openingHours() and $exposed lt 1 and $bunstat gte 50 and $chef_state is 1>>
	<<set $chef_state to 2>><<set $bun_value to 7500>>
	<<npc Sam>><<person1>>
	Sam approaches you, wiping <<his>> hands on a towel and beaming.
	"I've made a decision," <<he>> says. "I wanted to keep the buns affordable, but we've attracted interest."
	<<He>> holds out a holiday brochure, opened on a page that advertises the town.
	There's a picture of the cafe with a caption that describes the buns as "world-class."
	<br><br>

	"World-class!" Sam beams.
	"I've decided to increase the price to <<printmoney 7500>>. We have a limited supply after all, it's already difficult to keep up with demand as it is."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> returns to work, humming some tune.
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>>
	<<link [[Next|Ocean Breeze]]>><</link>>
	<br>

<<elseif Time.openingHours() and $exposed lt 1 and $bunstat gte 200 and $chef_state is 2>>
	<<set $chef_state to 3>>
	<<npc Sam>><<person1>>
	Sam approaches you.
	"I was at a party," <<he>> says.
	"And I may have had one too many. Anyway, the topic of our buns came up.
	People were very curious about how they're made. When I told them I didn't know, that a new chef was responsible, they became even hungrier.
	I think a myth is building around you."
	<br><br>
	"Anyway," <<he>> continues.
	"It got me thinking. I'd like to use your image in our advertisements.
	Maybe redesign the front of the building. It's only fair people know who's responsible for these treats."
	<br><br>
	"I'm willing to increase your cut to <span class="gold">30%</span> of each bun sale," <<he>> adds, cleaning a vacated table.
	"I'm in talks with a professional photographer. Mull it over, then let me know what you think."
	<br><br>

	<<endevent>>

	<<link [[Next|Ocean Breeze]]>><</link>>
	<br>

<<elseif Time.openingHours() and $exposed lt 1 and $chef_state is 5>>
	<<set $chef_state to 6>>
	<<npc Sam>>Sam approaches you. "The photographer sent the pictures over," <<he>> says.
	"They're fantastic! The new adverts are going to look great. You'll get <span class="gold">30%</span> of each bun sold from now on, as promised."
	<<set $bun_cut to 0.3>>
	<br><br>

	Sam returns to work, humming
	<<if $seabird_lullaby gte 2>>
		the first few notes of <span class="teal">Seabird's Lullaby</span>.
	<<else>>
		<<set $seabird_lullaby to 1>>
		some <span class="teal">faintly familiar</span> tune.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>>

	<<link [[Next|Ocean Breeze]]>><</link>>
	<br><br>

<<elseif Time.openingHours() and $exposed lt 1 and $bunstat gte 400 and $chef_state is 6>>
	<<set $chef_state to 7>>
	<<set $chef_rework to 37>>
	<<npc Sam>><<person1>>
	Sam approaches you, looking more serious than normal. "I've made a decision," <<he>> says.
	"The buns are our flagship, but people are more interested than ever in our other dishes too.
	Even when people know the chef is not in the building, they still queue for a chance to eat here. You've probably noticed."
	<br><br>
	"I've bought next-door," <<he>> continues.
	"The big one. I'm going to merge the buildings, make one huge cafe. One that can accommodate the numbers we're pulling. I'm giddy just thinking about it!"
	<br><br>
	<span class="pink">"We'll need to close for a month,"</span> <<he>> adds.
	"It's unfortunate, but the changes are so big. We'll have a grand opening event when it's done, with you as the star."
	<br><br>
	"We're closing down in a week. I don't want you to be caught off guard. Drop by when we're finished and we'll discuss the opening event."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> returns to work.
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>>
	<<link [[Next|Ocean Breeze]]>><</link>>
	<br>

<<elseif !$daily.earSlimeOceanBreezeCafeEat and Time.openingHours() and $exposed lt 1 and !$daily.cafeEaten and $money gte 200 and numberOfEarSlime() and ((earSlimeMakingMundaneRequests() and random(0,100) gte 90) or random(0,100) gte 96)>>
	<<set _cafeOptions to []>>
	<<if $money gte 200>>
		<<run _cafeOptions.push("coffee")>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $money gte 700 and !playerAwareTheyArePregnant()>>
		<<switch Time.season>>
			<<case "winter">><<run _cafeOptions.push("winter ale")>>
			<<case "spring">><<run _cafeOptions.push("fruity ale")>>
			<<case "summer">><<run _cafeOptions.push("shandy")>>
			<<default>><<run _cafeOptions.push("autumn ale")>>
		<</switch>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $money gte 500>>
		<<run _cafeOptions.push("fruit salad")>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $money gte 1000>>
		<<run _cafeOptions.push("pancake")>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $money gte 5000>>
		<<run _cafeOptions.push("deluxe cream bun")>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily.earSlimeOceanBreezeCafeEat to _cafeOptions.random()>>
	<span @class="$earSlime.startedThreats ? 'lewd' : 'lblue'">You feel the slime in your head command you to have <<= (["a","e","i","o","u"].some(letter => $daily.earSlimeOceanBreezeCafeEat.startsWith(letter))) ? "an" : "a">> $daily.earSlimeOceanBreezeCafeEat.</span>
	It promises rewards if you comply<<if $earSlime.startedThreats>> and threatens consequences if you do not<</if>>.
	<br><br>

	<<earSlimeCafeLinks "Obey">>
	<br>
	<<if $earSlime.startedThreats>>
		<<link [[Defy|Ocean Breeze Slime Defy]]>><<corruption -1>><<pain 8>><<stress 6>><<trauma 6>><<def 1>><</link>><<lcorruption>><<ggpain>><<ggtrauma>><<ggstress>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Ignore|Ocean Breeze]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if Time.hour is $closinghour>>
		It's closing time. Sam is herding everyone outside.
		<<if $exposed gte 1>>
			You feel a twinge of panic as you realise how exposed you'll be should you be found in this state of dress.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

	<<elseif !Time.openingHours()>>
		You are alone in the darkness.
		<br><br>

	<<elseif $exposed gte 1>>
		You are hiding beneath a table to protect your dignity.
		<br><br>

	<</if>>

	<<if $arousal gte $arousalmax>>
		<<orgasmLocation "cafe">>
	<</if>>

	<<if Time.openingHours() and $exposed lt 1 and $oceanbreezejob isnot 1>>
		<<if $oceanbreezejoboffer is 1>>
			<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask for work|Ocean Breeze Ask Again]]>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask for work|Ocean Breeze Ask]]>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>

	<<if Time.openingHours() and $exposed lt 1 and $oceanbreezejob is 1>>
		You see Sam attending to the customers. <<nnpc_He "Sam">> looks like <<nnpc_he "Sam">> could use some help.
		<br>
		<<if $chef_state is 0>>
			<<ind>><<link [[Accept job offer|Chef Work Accept]]>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<elseif $chef_state gte 1>>
			<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
				<span class="red">Both of your arms are bound</span>, so you are unable to work as a chef.
			<<else>>
				<<skinicon "chef">><<link [[Work as a chef (1:00)|Chef Work]]>><</link>>
			<</if>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<if $chef_state is 3>>
			<<ind>><<link [["Accept Sam's offer"|Chef Photographer]]>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
			<span class="red">Both of your arms are bound</span>, so you are unable to work as a <<pwaitress>>.
		<<else>>
			<<skinicon "waiter">><<link [[`Work as a <<pwaitress>> (1:00)`|Ocean Breeze Work]]>><<set $tablesservedstat += random(10,30)>><</link>>
		<</if>>
		<br>
	<</if>>

	<<if gwylanSchedule() is "cafe" and Time.openingHours() and $exposed lt 1>>
		<<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
		<<if _gwylanStatus?.includes("met")>>
			<<if getRobinLocation() is "cafe">>
				<br>
				Gwylan and Robin sit on the exterior balcony, gazing out to the sea.
				<br>
				<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Join them|Gwylan Ocean Breeze]]>><<set $phase to 3>><</link>>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				<br>
				Gwylan sits alone on the exterior balcony, gazing out to the sea.
				<br>
				<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Join <<nnpc_him 'Gwylan'>>|Gwylan Ocean Breeze]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>

<<if Time.openingHours() and $exposed lt 1 and $daily.cafeEaten isnot 1>>

	<<if $money gte 200>>
		<br>
		A menu lists what's currently being served.
		<br>
		<<foodicon "coffee">><<link [[Buy coffee (0:02 £2)|Cafe Coffee]]>>
			<<set $daily.cafeEaten to 1>><<money -200 "cafe">><<stress -3>><<tiredness -4>><<pass 2>>
		<</link>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $money gte 700>>
		<<if Time.season is "winter">>
			<<foodicon "winterale">>
			<<if playerIsPregnant() and playerAwareTheyArePregnant()>>
				<span class="blue">You can't bring yourself to drink winter ale while you know you're with child.</span>
			<<else>>
				<<link [[Buy winter ale (0:10 £7)|Cafe Eat]]>><<set $phase to "winter ale">><<set $daily.cafeEaten to 1>><<money -700 "cafe">><<stress -6>><<alcohol 100>><<pass 10>><</link>><<lstress>><<ggalcohol>>
			<</if>>
			<br>
		<<elseif Time.season is "spring">>
			<<foodicon "fruityale">>
			<<if playerIsPregnant() and playerAwareTheyArePregnant()>>
				<span class="blue">You can't bring yourself to drink fruity ale while you know you're with child.</span>
			<<else>>
				<<link [[Buy fruity ale (0:10 £7)|Cafe Eat]]>><<set $phase to "fruity ale">><<set $daily.cafeEaten to 1>><<money -700 "cafe">><<stress -6>><<alcohol 60>><<pass 10>><</link>><<lstress>><<galcohol>>
			<</if>>
			<br>
		<<elseif Time.season is "summer">>
			<<foodicon "shandy">>
			<<if playerIsPregnant() and playerAwareTheyArePregnant()>>
				<span class="blue">You can't bring yourself to drink shandy while you know you're with child.</span>
			<<else>>
				<<link [[Buy shandy (0:10 £7)|Cafe Eat]]>><<set $phase to "shandy">><<set $daily.cafeEaten to 1>><<money -700 "cafe">><<stress -6>><<alcohol 40>><<pass 10>><</link>><<lstress>><<galcohol>>
			<</if>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<foodicon "autumnale">>
			<<if playerIsPregnant() and playerAwareTheyArePregnant()>>
				<span class="blue">You can't bring yourself to drink autumn ale while you know you're with child.</span>
			<<else>>
				<<link [[Buy autumn ale (0:10 £7)|Cafe Eat]]>><<set $phase to "autumn ale">><<set $daily.cafeEaten to 1>><<money -700 "cafe">><<stress -6>><<alcohol 80>><<pass 10>><</link>><<lstress>><<galcohol>>
			<</if>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $money gte 300>>
		<<if ndef $milkshake>><<set $milkshake to 0>><</if>>
		<<if $milkshake lt 2>>
			<<foodicon "milkshake">><<link [[Buy milkshake to go (0:02 £3)|Ocean Breeze]]>><<money -300 "cafe">> <<set $milkshake +=1>> <<pass 2>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $money gte 500>>
		<<foodicon "fruitsalad">>
		<<link [[Buy fruit salad (0:20 £5)|Cafe Eat]]>><<set $phase to "fruit salad">><<set $daily.cafeEaten to 1>><<money -500 "cafe">><<stress -6>><<pass 20>><</link>><<lstress>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $money gte 600 and Time.season is "winter">>
		<<foodicon "gingerbread">>
		<<link [[Buy gingerbread (0:20 £6)|Cafe Eat]]>><<set $phase to "gingerbread">><<set $daily.cafeEaten to 1>><<money -600 "cafe">><<stress -8>><<pass 20>><</link>><<lstress>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $money gte 1000>>
		<<foodicon "pancakes">>
		<<link [[Buy pancakes (0:20 £10)|Cafe Pancakes]]>><<set $phase to "pancakes">><<set $daily.cafeEaten to 1>><<money -1000 "cafe">><<tiredness -6>><<pass 20>><</link>><<ltiredness>>
		<br>
		<<foodicon "crepes">>
		<<link [[Buy crepes (0:20 £10)|Cafe Pancakes]]>><<set $phase to "crepes">><<set $daily.cafeEaten to 1>><<money -1000 "cafe">><<tiredness -6>><<pass 20>><</link>><<ltiredness>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $money gte 5000>>
		<<foodicon "creambun">>
		<<link [[Buy Deluxe Cream Bun (0:20 £50)|Cafe Cream Bun]]>><<set $daily.cafeEaten to 1>><<transform cat 1>><<money -5000 "cafe">><<pass 20>><<stress -18>><</link>><<llstress>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

<<if !Time.openingHours() and Time.hour isnot $closinghour and !$weekly.theft.oceanBreeze>>
	<<shopicon "register">><<link [[Examine the cash register|Ocean Breeze Register]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

<br>
<<clifficon>><<link [[Leave|Cliff Street]]>><</link>>
<br><br>

<</if>>

:: Ocean Breeze Lock
<<set $outside to 1>><<effects>><<set $lock to 200>>
The cafe is closed. <<openinghours>>
<br><br>

<<if currentSkillValue('skulduggery') gte $lock>>
	<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
		You think you'd be able to pick the lock, <span class="blue">if your arms weren't bound.</span>
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		<<wearProp "lockpick">>
		<span class="green">The lock looks easy to pick.</span>
		<br><br>

		<<lockicon "pick">><<link [[Pick it (0:10)|Ocean Breeze]]>><<pass 10>><<crimeUp 5 "trespassing">><</link>><<crime "trespassing">>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">The lock looks beyond your ability to pick.</span><<skulduggeryrequired>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<clifficon>><<link [[Leave|Cliff Street]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Ocean Breeze Ask
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<set $oceanbreezejoboffer to 1>>
<<npc Sam>><<person1>>
You walk up to the overweight <<personsimple>> behind the counter. <<He>> smiles at you.
"Aren't you a cutie! What will it be?"
<br><br>

You ask if <<he>> has any work for you. <<His>> smile broadens.
"As a matter of fact, I need a cute <<pwaitress>>.
The pay is £5 an hour, plus tips. Just a warning though: some customers might try to grope you.
Please be patient with them; they don't mean nothing by it! We're always understaffed, so you can work whenever we're open."
<br><br>

<<link [[Take job|Ocean Breeze Take Job]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Refuse job|Ocean Breeze]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Ocean Breeze Take Job
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<set $oceanbreezejob to 1>>

"Splendid!" <<he>> says, grabbing your hand in both of <<his>> own and shaking. "I'm Sam, by the way. This here is Ocean Breeze Cafe, the heart of our town's gossip and caffeine fixes. Come on, let me show you the ropes."
<br><br>

Sam shows you around, conversing along the way. "We serve smiles just as much as we serve coffee!" <<He>> smiles brightly. "Let's start with the basics. You'll be handling orders, refills, and most importantly, learning everyone's quirks. That one likes their pie before their coffee, for example. Sometimes the mayor visits, and <<nnpc_he "Quinn">> likes <<nnpc_his "Quinn">> tea stirred exactly seven times. Oh! And if you see a certain grumpy fisherman at the counter?" <<He>> leans in conspiratorially. "Extra bacon. Always."
<br><br>

<<He>> leads you behind the counter where the rich smell of coffee beans and baking pastries grows stronger. "I've another employee over there who'll teach you our signature drinks. And this"—<<he>> pats an ancient but well-polished cash register with affection—"is Old Betsy. She gets stuck sometimes, but just give her a gentle nudge."
<br><br>

<<He>> clasps <<his>> hands together excitedly. "So! Ready for your first shift? The <<= Time.hour lte 3 or Time.hour gte 18 ? "dinner" : Time.hour lte 12 ? "breakfast" : "lunch">> rush is about to begin!"
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Ocean Breeze]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Ocean Breeze Ask Again
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>

<<npc Sam>><<person1>>You walk up to the overweight <<personsimple>> behind the counter. <<He>> smiles at you.
"Welcome back! Have you reconsidered?"
<br><br>

<<link [[Take job|Ocean Breeze Take Job]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Refuse job|Ocean Breeze]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Ocean Breeze Work
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<set C.npc.Sam.love = Math.clamp(C.npc.Sam.love, -50, 50)>>
<<set _gwylanLocation to gwylanSchedule()>>

<<if (_gwylanLocation is "walking_to_cafe" or _gwylanLocation is "sulking") and $gwylan_cafe_intro and !$daily.gwylan.cafe>>
	<<set $daily.gwylan.cafe to true>>
	<<if $gwylanSeen?.includes("cafe") and C.npc.Gwylan.love gte 30>>
		You leave a plate of <<seagullFood>> next to the register for Gwylan, and start your shift.
		<<if _gwylanLocation is "sulking">>
			<span class="red"><<nnpc_He "Gwylan">> never shows up to take it.</span>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		As you start your shift, you see a plate of unattended <<seagullFood>> near the register. Gwylan enters a moment later, picking up the plate and leaving exact change neatly on the countertop before heading out to the balcony.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if !$gwylan_cafe_intro and ["cafe", "walking_to_cafe"].includes(_gwylanLocation)>>
	<<npc Gwylan 1>><<npc Sam 2>><<person1>>
	<<set $daily.gwylan.cafe to true>>
	<<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
	As you're serving tables, you notice a plate of <<seagullFood>> sitting unattended near the register.
	<br><br>

	You look around. No one seems to be paying it any mind.
	<br><br>

	<<if _gwylanStatus.includes("met") and _gwylanLocation is "cafe">>
		As you wonder what to do with it, you see Gwylan stand up from <<his>> seat out on the balcony and step in front of the register.
	<<else>>
		As you wonder what to do with it, a <<nnpc_gendery "Gwylan">> with mousy hair steps in front of the register. <<Hes>> wearing an oversized sun hat.
		<<if _gwylanStatus.includes("met")>>
			It's Gwylan.
		<</if>>
	<</if>>

	<<if $gwylanSeen?.includes("cafe")>>
		<<He>> neatly leaves a few bills and coins on the counter, stacked by coin size.
		<<He>> notices you, and gives you a smile and a wave before taking the plate
		<<if _gwylanLocation is "cafe">>
			back to the balcony.
		<<else>>
			to <<his>> usual table on the balcony.
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> neatly leaves a few bills and coins on the counter, stacked by coin size, before taking the plate
		<<if _gwylanStatus.includes("met") and _gwylanLocation is "cafe">>
			back to the balcony.
		<<else>>
			to a table on the exterior balcony.
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $gwylanSeen?.includes("cafe")>>
		"Looks like our little seagull found a friend,"
	<<else>>
		"That's just our little seagull,"
	<</if>>
	Sam's voice says from behind you. "<<Hes>> a real sweetheart, just like <<his>> <<father>>." <<person2>><<He>> smiles, before handing you a glass of orange juice. <<wearProp "juice" "tangerine">>
	"Could you bring this to <<person1>><<him>>? Tell <<him>> it's on the house. <<He>> could use the vitamin C. <<He>> never gets any sunlight, always hiding under those big hats."
	<br><br>

	<<if $sciencetrait gte 1>>
		You decide against correcting <<person2>><<him>> about sunlight helping with vitamin D, not vitamin C.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<person1>>

	<<link [[Take it to <<him>>|Ocean Breeze Gwylan Juice]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<cleareventpool>>

	<<if !$weekly.robinCafeVisit and C.npc.Robin.init gte 1 and $robinmissing is 0 and !["school", "sleep"].includes(getRobinLocation())>>
		<<set $weekly.robinCafeVisit to true>>
		<<if _gwylanLocation is "cafe" and $gwylanSeen?.includes("cafe") and $gwylan_cafe_intro and $gwylan?.robin gte 5>>
			<<addinlineevent "robin_cafe_gwylan" 4>>
				<<npc Robin 1>><<npc Gwylan 2>><<person1>>
				You are cleaning off a table after a previous customer when you see a familiar face in the corner of your eye. It's Robin. <<person1>><<Hes>> sitting at a table on the balcony, talking to someone.
				<br><br>

				<<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>
					<<set $gwylanSeen.pushUnique("robin_cafe_trauma")>>
					<<gwylanRobin 3 25>>
					You can't quite hear their conversation, as Robin speaks in hushed tones.
					You crane your neck to get a look at the other person. It's Gwylan. There's a look of mixed sadness and fascination on <<person2>><<his>> face as <<he>> listens to Robin.
					<br><br>

					<<generateRole 2 0 "waiter/waitress">>
					A <<person3>><<personsimple>> approaches them and addresses Robin. "I saw you switch tables, kid. Sorry, but you're still gonna have to buy something. It's company policy. We are running a—"
					<br><br>

					<<person1>>
					"<<Hes>> with me," Gwylan interrupts. "<<He>> will have my usual. Now, please, you're interrupting an important story." <<person2>><<He>> waves the <<person3>><<personsimple>> away, who shrugs.
					<br><br>

					"I-I can't afford that," Robin says.
					<br><br>

					"You're not paying for it," Gwylan responds with a smile. "Now, from where you left off?"
					<br><br>

					They continue speaking in hushed tones. You leave the two of them to their talk. By the end, Robin looks happier. <<npcincr Robin trauma -5>><<llrtrauma>>
					<br><br>

					The rest of the shift passes uneventfully. You earn <<money 500 "cafeWaiter">><<printmoney 500>>.
				<<else>>
					<<set $gwylanSeen.pushUnique("robin_cafe")>>
					<<gwylanRobin 1 25>>
