		<</if>>
	<</addinlineevent>>

	<<addinlineevent "cafe_crowd" 1>>
		<<if dangerEvent(0.25,4000)>> /* Roughly 33% at game start, max 80% */
			<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generate3>><<generate4>>
			A large group enters the cafe, taking up several tables by themselves.
			You try to ask for their order, but a <<person1>><<person>> sitting at the head interrupts you.
			"It's my birthday today, you know. How about something special?" <<He>> openly ogles your body. "Wanna climb up on the table and give us a dance?"
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Dance for them|Ocean Breeze Dance]]>>
				<<danceinit>><<set $dancing to 1>><<set $audience to 4>><<set $venuemod to 2>><<set $timer to 12>><<set $dancelocation to "cafe">>
			<</link>><<exhibitionist1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Refuse|Ocean Breeze Dance Refuse]]>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			A large group enters the cafe, taking up several tables by themselves. They don't give you any trouble though.
			<br><br>

			<<waiter_default>>
			<<pass 1 hour>>
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Ocean Breeze]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</addinlineevent>>

	<<addinlineevent "cafe_dog" 1>>
		<!-- Modified for Monster People -->
		<<beastNEWinit 1 dog>>
		<<if $rng gte 51 and ($monster is 1 or $settings.bestialityEnabled)>>
			Sam asks you to take some trash to the dumpster beside the cafe. Stood beside the dumpster, however, is a stray <<beasttype>>. It growls as you approach.
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Continue regardless|Ocean Breeze Dumpster Dog]]>><<stress 6>><</link>><<gstress>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Forget your task and go back inside|Ocean Breeze Dumpster Refuse]]>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<endevent>>
			<<generate1>><<generate2>>
			Sam asks you to take some trash to the dumpster beside the cafe.
			Stood beside the dumpster, however, are a <<fullGroup>>. They have a dangerous look about them.
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Continue regardless|Ocean Breeze Dumpster]]>><<stress 6>><</link>><<gstress>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Forget your task and go back inside|Ocean Breeze Dumpster Refuse]]>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<</addinlineevent>>

	<<if $chef_state is undefined>>
		<<if C.npc.Sam.love gte 10>>
			<<addinlineevent "cafe_chef_start" 2>>
				<<npc Sam>><<person1>>Sam rushes out of the kitchen, looking flustered.
				<<He>> glances in your direction, <span class="green">then hastens over.</span>
				"I'm in a bit of a pickle," <<he>> says.
				"Our chef's stormed off again. I need someone to fill in. Don't worry, it's not hard, and I'll pay you double. Will you help me out?"
				<br><br>

				<<link [[Accept|Chef Help]]>><<npcincr Sam love 2>><</link>><<glove Sam>>
				<br>
				<<link [[Refuse|Ocean Breeze Chef Refuse]]>><<npcincr Sam love -1>><</link>><<llove Sam>>
				<br>
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<<else>>
			<<addinlineevent "cafe_chef_denied" 1>>
				<<npc Sam>><<person1>>Sam rushes out of the kitchen, looking flustered.
				<<He>> glances in your direction, <span class="red">but passes over you.</span>
				<<He>> approaches another member of staff, and offers them better pay to fill in for the chef this shift.
				<i>Perhaps Sam would be willing to give you a chance if <<he>> liked you more.</i>
				<br><br>

				<<waiter_default>>
				<<pass 1 hour>>
				<br><br>

				<<link [[Next|Ocean Breeze]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>

	<<runeventpool>>
<</if>>

:: Ocean Breeze Gwylan Juice
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>><<wearProp "juice" "tangerine">>
<<person1>>You bring the glass of orange juice to the balcony.
<<if Weather.precipitation isnot "none">>
	The roof of the cafe extends far enough to shield it from the <<print Weather.precipitation>>.
<</if>>
<<if _gwylanStatus.includes("met")>>
	Gwylan
<<else>>
	The mousy <<nnpc_gendery "Gwylan">>
<</if>>
seems to be lost in thought as <<he>> stares out at the ocean. You place the drink on <<his>> table.
<br><br>

"I didn't pay for that, dear," <<he>> says without looking at you. <<His>> tone is distant, but polite.
<br><br>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"I-it's on the house," you say. "My boss is worried about you. <<person2>><<He>> thinks you need more vitamin C."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"I didn't ask you to pay for it," you say. "Sam is worried about you. <<person2>><<He>> thinks you're going to get scurvy."
<<else>>
	"It's on the house," you say. "My boss is worried about you, and said you need more vitamin C."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if _gwylanStatus.includes("met")>>
	<<person1>><<He>> perks up upon hearing your voice, and turns to you. "I didn't know you worked here, what a pleasant surprise!"
	<<He>> gives you a warm smile.
<<else>>
	<<person1>><<He>> sighs.
<</if>>
"I'm grateful, but I don't know what Sammy is worried about. I eat plenty of fruit," <<he>> says. "Did <<person2>><<he>> get vitamin C and vitamin D mixed up again?"
<br><br>

<<person1>><<He>> takes a small sip of the juice.
<<if !_gwylanStatus.includes("met")>>
	<<set $daily.gwylan.firstMet to true>>
	After setting <<his>> drink down, <<he>> turns to you and eyes your clothes.
	<<if $worn.upper.type.includes("serving")>>
		"It's nice to see you representing Sam so well."
	<<elseif $worn.upper.type.includes("costume")>>
		"You have good taste. Not everyone would wear that while working."
	<<else>>
		"If you don't mind some advice, you may find your customers more willing to pay extra if you dress up for the job. It would help Sam out, too."
	<</if>>
	<<He>> smiles, standing up.
	<br><br>

	<<He>> looks about your age, with mousy hair and a hint of freckles. "I'm older than I look," <<he>> says, as if reading your mind.
	"<span class="green">I'm Gwylan.</span>" <<He>> reaches forward, lifts your hand, and shakes it in both <<his>> own. "Pleased to meet you. I have a shop in the outskirts of the forest. You can't miss it. I sell—"
	<<He>> pauses. "My grand<<father>> sells—" Another pause. "I sell clothes and knick-knacks there. <span class="blue">Things you won't find in normal shops.</span> Even I don't know what I have in stock!" <<He>> sounds proud.
	<br><br>

	"But enough of that. Thank you for the drink, dear."
<<elseif !$forest_shop_intro>>
	"Thank you. I'm still looking forward to you visiting my shop," <<he>> says.
<<elseif $gwylan.request.event is "meetAtShop">>
	"Thank you. Don't forget to stop by the forest shop later. You still need to make up for breaking into my garden."
<<else>>
	"Thank you."
<</if>>
<<set $gwylan.timer.lastSeen to Time.date.timeStamp>>
<<He>> returns to gazing at the ocean.
<br><br>

<<set $gwylan_cafe_intro to true>>
<<set $tipmod to 0.2>><<tipset "serving">>

<<set $tip += 500>>
<<set $tip += 100>>

The rest of the shift passes uneventfully. Gwylan left you a tip.
<<tipreceive "cafeWaiter">>
<<pass 1 hour>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Ocean Breeze]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

